    {
      "id": "les-d-04",
      "rank": "D",
      "module": "mod-d-1",
      "title": "there is/are: − и ?; предлоги места",
      "grammar_point": {
        "id": "gp-d-04",
        "title_ru": "Отрицания/вопросы there is; предлоги места",
        "rule_md": "**there is/are: вопросы и предлоги места.**\nВопрос: **Is there** a café near here? — Yes, there is. / No, there isn't.\n**Where is** the bank? — It is in Main Street.\nПредлоги места: **in** the bag, **on** the table, **at** the corner,\n**next to** the bank, **under** the table, **between** the shop and the café,\n**in front of** the hotel, **behind** the church.",
        "phrase_ids": ["ph-d-0134", "ph-d-0135", "ph-d-0136", "ph-d-0137", "ph-d-0138"],
